{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859100/extras/1fcd1f27b8aa2c64df6a3a733d0c9eae.avif?t=1764955636\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859100/extras_big/1fcd1f27b8aa2c64df6a3a733d0c9eae.avif?t=1764955636 width=800 height=854 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city of Gadola is a rising metropolis known far and wide as a center of trade and mercantilism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the past few decades, its prosperous markets and unique geographical location have attracted countless travelers from across the continent seeking riches and fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nevertheless, the growing gap between the rich and the poor has not only led to rising crime rates, it's also worsened public security as the city's population surges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath its prosperous facade lies a seedy and corrupt underbelly. Young women struggle to survive in the cracks of this merciless society, refusing to bow to fate no matter what it takes...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the protagonist, Hills, as she freely roams the city, interacting with all sorts of characters to trigger a variety of events! Your choices will determine how the story unfolds\u2014will you uncover the dark truth hidden beneath the city and successfully avert the looming crisis before it's too late?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbBeware of malicious men!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commoners and nobles alike can hide ill intentions beneath a friendly smile. Be wary of their sweet nothings and empty flatteries\u2014one slip-up could put Hills in the hands of a perverted creepo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbFree yourself and others within the allotted time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hills and her companions are caught in a massive conspiracy. If their whereabouts are exposed...you don't even want to think about what will happen to them. With women suffering such cruel abuse, who could be so heartless as to turn away?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFreely explore the city of Gadola, unlocking various new locations as the story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA standalone sequel to The Adventures of Micoco\u2014featuring the return of Micoco and those slimy, unforgettable tentacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbExquisitely animated character illustrations and dynamic CGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA heart-racing story with multiple endings\u2014Hills's fate is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***No need to play the prequel to enjoy the game and storyline!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859100/extras/fd3adb769f9497c4daad2e1db8888494.poster.avif?t=1764955636\" width=652 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859100/extras/fd3adb769f9497c4daad2e1db8888494.webm?t=1764955636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859100/extras/fd3adb769f9497c4daad2e1db8888494.mp4?t=1764955636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859100/extras/c0b302b1d38ffb054a9fedafbf8e5ec3.poster.avif?t=1764955636\" width=653 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st